{"title":"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Positive\">positive</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6a8a28561bb75fdba8b863404ee7115371e3b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> denote the unique positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36fc80dbd4f81d07b6350f877127d67b31867064.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|k-\\sqrt{p}| &lt; \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />.  For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/0/980375d03f43ba239f57901d141c9f6bd56d9299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(6) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/b/95bc0826480f6f524649cb7dc6478cb2687bf271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(23) = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/5/6057998893f720de7eb812139fd71384768b417e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\sum_{p=1}^{2007} b(p),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"101\" height=\"52\" /> find the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Remainder\" title=\"Remainder\">remainder</a> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by 1000.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/0/5e077c12df492ce59ed3c58ef57b5f8a75218d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(k- \\frac 12\\right)^2=k^2-k+\\frac 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"186\" height=\"46\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f34ac7460ac5444a412ba8550d5ac2531c3a6624.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(k+ \\frac 12\\right)^2=k^2+k+ \\frac 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"186\" height=\"46\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/a/a7a0df7276bd0d97c51ab78ec5045de7c0d3ed48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is in this range, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/0/3305e55be351d7b4c46c45f0518324b49845781a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2-k&lt;p\\leq k^2+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"156\" height=\"18\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8ea7ee8a282949fd853a01537ec7a2b55e56f75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> numbers in this range, so the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6a8a28561bb75fdba8b863404ee7115371e3b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> over this range is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed240d850d2abe63ef64325f08fa8c9d2907b8eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2k)k=2k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"19\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e52f01cc915e52583e05f5616ea98c81234d2038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44&lt;\\sqrt{2007}&lt;45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />, so all numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45828f292e161290be6ee62bc4c9df081ee1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> have their full range. Summing this up with the formula for the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> squares (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/4/cc4f0f92307334d9c869db668d45b9e67b9ac250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"135\" height=\"38\" />), we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/8885da46f4888b918959693e5d7099f9908b421d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{44}2k^2=2\\frac{44(44+1)(2*44+1)}{6}=58740$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"333\" height=\"50\" />. We need only consider the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d919524ae73a4dd7581e536fd37cd5dd0978ca95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$740$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> because we are working with modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Now consider the range of numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/0744f7b11a110c48886ce91fc7e66a93eace85e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />. These numbers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bacc5b95f250d8d1044802d5b401b1399f3aa581.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{44^2 + 45^2}{2}\\right\\rceil = 1981$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"157\" height=\"43\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0db9f93bcba529c93ae151a1ac5c740eec7cca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba36ae2d001ed01890c52117ac855fe7d0bea0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007 - 1981 + 1 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"168\" height=\"14\" /> (1 to be inclusive) of them. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/e/3ee9cc197845c2f2919b9ddccd1c2b06ecc85a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27*45=1215$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfd449c82093b0a3946cdc51691b26a896a5fa8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$215+740= \\boxed{955}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" />, the answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be in the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324aee7e573fe1a32e45889362d6e75855ce4f37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 \\le p &lt; (a+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />. Then, we need to find the point where the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6a8a28561bb75fdba8b863404ee7115371e3b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> flips from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f05f085f774fc8ab50676b778b86a1f1d1114fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />. This will happen when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> exceeds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/7/fc75cad1a0fab53bbc0199185ebc7dcb993ffad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+\\frac{1}{2})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/205738b22f572a9156a3e6f725a7e9b6fe3b1bf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(a+1)+\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"37\" />. Thus, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d80105d72f025e310f811b081fc2e9c9cd2e8e92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 \\le p \\le a(a+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"19\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d569380b71ae73a2af7ef5594c001f37ec82cb92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/f/f1fbe389e2a0d8cca009dee69e354493b95c9b19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(a+1) &lt; p &lt; (a+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"183\" height=\"19\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d109be3ba14c0d3e4e280cfa674e80c4a15b78c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)=a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/b/64be5731bafe97ab8fb5d0f9c52c1c5362f963d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> terms in the first set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> terms in the second set. Thus, the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6a8a28561bb75fdba8b863404ee7115371e3b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/2/dc2876ff9f87123ec9310b990cf5c0796bc007f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 \\le p &lt;(a+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cffc876a8fce796c18525353e9153f369d84f39e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a(a+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d18c30970f12b39509c54bbf08f831097b25eb2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot\\binom{a+1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"87\" height=\"53\" />. For the time being, consider that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/1348230ab7f4039ac311220d87c7ceab04e5569f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\sum_{p=1}^{44^2-1} b(p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"105\" height=\"56\" />. Then, the sum of the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6a8a28561bb75fdba8b863404ee7115371e3b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da487019a5a8ea77018137fa02a74f92f1d47c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\binom{2}{2}+4\\binom{3}{2}+\\cdots +4\\binom{44}{2}=4\\left(\\binom{2}{2}+\\binom{3}{2}+\\cdots +\\binom{44}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"505\" height=\"53\" />. We can collapse this to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a31455c75edfc706bc26b27dd45b0c3004e99b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\binom{45}{3}=56760$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"124\" height=\"53\" />. Now, we have to consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/9/0791facc6653bc513a59efed100ffd7a558e69fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44^2 \\le p &lt; 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" />. Considering <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> from just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/2/5b2132b1e42be9a1cba5790bd31b2e93b21a6c6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44^2 \\le p \\le 1980$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" />, we see that all of these values have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b4718ecfdaae8c1a54e5429673251064e8bd8e79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />. Because there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in that range, the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6a8a28561bb75fdba8b863404ee7115371e3b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> in that range is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e24e4ca5c1d6c3540f22ba16b2d223013b04c31d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45\\cdot44=1980$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" />. Adding this to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d2989a14d5f0e1c69b8b7e8ff6d615e5f4113255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56760$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/3035a8b49e40dac92767a8fedccf5aac5e0396fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$58740$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d919524ae73a4dd7581e536fd37cd5dd0978ca95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$740$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. Now, take the range <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/3/bf3c6ebfbc9113ba38aafd1492014bf6987651b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1980 &lt; p \\le 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in this range, and each has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/0744f7b11a110c48886ce91fc7e66a93eace85e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(p)=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, that contributes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/e/3ee9cc197845c2f2919b9ddccd1c2b06ecc85a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27*45=1215$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/b/42b46075834e67d2c313328fd6321b72dcf35613.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to the sum. Finally, adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d919524ae73a4dd7581e536fd37cd5dd0978ca95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$740$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/b/42b46075834e67d2c313328fd6321b72dcf35613.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5750641b8cac305bea1a351d9d354a4a2b40249.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$740+215=\\boxed{955}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~firebolt360\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kKrhL8dtDTw?si=tW____XMQ7_YP7AY\">2007 AIME I #11</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathproblemsolvingskills.wordpress.com/\">MathProblemSolvingSkills.com</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I\" title=\"2007 AIME I\">2007 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"